1240,,Maria,maria_d,\"What would you like?\",Chicken Scarpariello: {price:chicken_scarpariello}|Margherita Pizza: {price:margherita_pizza}|Pollo Funghi Penne: {price:chicken_and_mushroom_penne}|Chili Shrimp Fettuccine: {price:chili_shrimp_fettuccine}|Spaghetti Bolognese: {price:spaghetti_bolognese}|Nothing,1241|1243|1245|1247|1249|1251,
1241,can_afford:chicken_scarpariello,Maria,maria_d,\"Enjoy your Chicken Scarpariello.\",,1240,buy_item:chicken_scarpariello
1242,cannot_afford:chicken_scarpariello,Maria,maria_d,\"You can't afford that.\",,1240,
1243,can_afford:margherita_pizza,Maria,maria_d,\"Margherita Pizza is my favorite dish.\",,1240,buy_item:margherita_pizza
1244,cannot_afford:margherita_pizza,Maria,maria_d,\"You can't afford that.\",,1240,
1245,can_afford:chicken_and_mushroom_penne,Maria,maria_d,\"Chicken and Mushroom Penne.\\nMy mamma's specialty.\",,1240,buy_item:chicken_and_mushroom_penne
1246,cannot_afford:chicken_and_mushroom_penne,Maria,maria_d,\"You can't afford that.\",,1240,
1247,can_afford:chili_shrimp_fettuccine,Maria,maria_d,\"Watch out!\\nThe Chili Shrimp Fettuccine has a kick.\",,1240,buy_item:chili_shrimp_fettuccine
1248,cannot_afford:chili_shrimp_fettuccine,Maria,maria_d,\"You can't afford that.\",,1240,
1249,can_afford:spaghetti_bolognese,Maria,maria_d,\"A classic Spaghetti Bolognese.\",,1240,buy_item:spaghetti_bolognese
1250,cannot_afford:spaghetti_bolognese,Maria,maria_d,\"You can't afford that.\",,1240,
1251,,Maria,maria_d,\"Bye.\\nWe'll be open until 11pm.\",,END,
