1258,,Gina,gina_d,\"Hey there, hun.\\nTake a seat anywhere you'd like.\",,1259,
1259,,Summer,gina_d,\"Thanks. I'm just looking for now.\",,END,
1260,,Gina,gina_d,\"What can I get ya?\",Cheese Burger: {price:cheese_burger}|Chicken Fried Steak: {price:chicken_fried_steak}|Ruben Sandwich: {price:ruben_sandwich}|Bowl of Chili: {price:bowl_of_chili}|Breakfast Platter: {price:breakfast_platter}|Nothing,1261|1263|1265|1267|1269|1271,
