1262,cannot_afford:cheese_burger,Gina,gina_d,\"You don't have enough for.\",,1260,
1263,can_afford:chicken_fried_steak,Gina,gina_d,\"Chicken Fried Steak is a best seller.\",,1260,buy_item:chicken_fried_steak
1264,cannot_afford:chicken_fried_steak,Gina,gina_d,\"You don't have enough for.\",,1260,
