1266,cannot_afford:ruben_sandwich,Gina,gina_d,\"You don't have enough for.\",,1260,
1267,can_afford:bowl_of_chili,Gina,gina_d,\"A Bowl of Chili will warm you up.\",,1260,buy_item:bowl_of_chili
1268,cannot_afford:bowl_of_chili,Gina,gina_d,\"You don't have enough for.\",,1260,
1269,can_afford:breakfast_platter,Gina,gina_d,\"The Breakfast Platter is perfect any time of the day.\",,1260,buy_item:breakfast_platter
1270,cannot_afford:breakfast_platter,Gina,gina_d,\"You don't have enough for.\",,1260,
1271,,Gina,gina_d,\"Take care.\",,END,
