1303,time:1600-2400&not_knows:Ape,Max,max_d,\"How can I help you?\",This Place|Price|Goodbye,1304|1316|1334,
1304,,Summer,max_d,\"What’s up with this place?\",,1305,
1305,,Max,max_d,\"This is a combination; bowling alley, arcade, and laundromat.\",,1306,
1306,,Max,max_d,\"The first of its kind.\",,1307,
1307,,Max,max_d,\"An experince only to be found in the great town of Driftwood.\",,1308,
1308,,Summer,max_d,\"That's cool.\",,1309,
1309,,Max,max_d,\"You see, there are bowling pins, pin ball machines, and clothing pins. That’s why I called this place, Pins.\",,1310,
1310,,Summer,max_d,\"Oh, interesting.\",,1311,
1311,,Max,max_d,\"There was an eatery when I bought the place.\",,1312,
1312,,Max,max_d,\"Since Driftwood already has so many great food options; I decided to convert the space into something the town didn’t have.\",,1313,
1313,,Max,max_d,\"A laundromat.\",,1314,
1314,,Summer,max_d,\"Okay. Can we talk about something else?\",,1315,
1315,,Max,max_d,\"Oh, sure.\",,1290,
1316,,Summer,max_d,\"How much for a game?\",,1317,
1317,,Max,max_d,\"During the day, like now, it’s only three bucks for a game. If you need shoes, that’s an extra dollar.\",,1318,
1318,,Max,max_d,\"I also have cans of soda available for fifty cents.\",,1319,
1319,,Max,max_d,\"But I am out of root beer right now.\",,1320,
1320,,Summer,max_d,\"Good to know. Maybe some other time.\",,1290,
1321,,Summer,max_d,\"Have you seen any radios laying around in the arcade?\",,1322,
1322,,Max,max_d,\"No. I can’t say that I have.\",,1323,
1323,,Summer,max_d,\"It's okay. You can tell me. I'm a detective.\",,1324,
1324,,Max,max_d,\"Haha.\",,1325,
1325,,Max,max_d,\"Good one.\",,1326,
1326,,Summer,max_d,\"Thanks.\",,1327,
1327,,Max,max_d,\"I haven't seen any radios.\",,1290,
1328,,Summer,max_d,\"Has anyone been on the Ape Architect machine today?\",,1329,
1329,,Max,max_d,\"Yeah, there was one kid, Rodney. He was playing that game.\",,1330,secretly_learn:Rodney_Who
1330,,Max,max_d,\"I think he even got the new high score before he left for lunch.\",,1331,
1331,,Summer,max_d,\" For lunch?\",,1332,
1332,,Max,max_d,\"Yeah, he told me he would be back after lunch. I guess he has a bunch of quarters burning a hole in pocket.\",,1333,
1333,,Max,max_d,\"Not that I’m going to complain.\",,1290,
1334,,Summer,max_d,\"See ya.\",,END,
1335,,,,\"\",,,
1336,,Summer,,\"Oh, there's a phone.\",,END,
1337,,,,\"\",,,
1338,,Summer,max_d,\"Excuse me. Would I be able to use your phone?\",,1339,
1339,,Max,max_d,\"Knock yourself out.\",,1340,
1340,,Max,max_d,\"Just no long distance phone calls.\",,1341,secretly_learn:Phone_Permission
1341,,Summer,max_d,\"Okay.\",,END,secretly_forget:Pins_Phone
1342,,,,\"\",,,
1343,,,,\"\",,,
1344,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Hello.\",,END,
1345,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Hi, my name is Summer. I am here on vacation with my family.\",,1346,
1346,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Hi Summer. I am Sammy.\",,1347,
1347,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"I hope you like our little town so far.\",,1348,
1348,knows:Met_Dave,Summer,sammy_d,\"I think it’s growing on me.\",,1349,
1349,not_knows:Met_Dave,Summer,sammy_d,\". . .\",,1350,
1350,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Are you here for the Newt Festival?\",,1351,
1351,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Yeah.\\nMy dad grew up here.\\nHe wanted to go to the Festival.\",,1352,
1352,,Summer,sammy_d,\"It seems a little weird to me.\",,1353,
1353,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Oh Sweetie, it's a lot weird but it’s a lot of fun too.\",,1354,
1354,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"The whole town comes out for it. \",,1355,
1355,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"There are newt themed treats, people dress up like newts, and If we’re lucky, we’ll see some honest-to-goodness newts on the beach that night.\",,1356,secretly_learn:Newt
1356,,Summer,sammy_d,\"That actually sounds like it could be fun.\",,1357,
1357,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"It’s great to have such a strong sense of community.\",,1358,
1358,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Can I ask you some questions?\",,1359,
1359,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Sure.\",,1360,
1360,knows:Queens&knows:Met_Dave,Sammy,sammy_d,\"What would you like to ask?\",Laundry|Around Town|Queens of Egypt|Radio|Goodbye,1378|1382|1364|1386|1388,
1361,knows:Queens&not_knows:Met_Dave,Sammy,sammy_d,\"What would you like to ask?\",Laundry|Around Town|Queens of Egypt|Goodbye,1378|1382|1364|1388,
1362,knows:Met_Dave,Sammy,sammy_d,\"What would you like to ask?\",Laundry|Around Town|Radio|Goodbye,1378|1382|1386|1388,
1363,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"What would you like to ask?\",Laundry|Around Town|Goodbye,1378|1382|1388,
1364,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Have you ever played Queens of Egypt? It looks fun.\",,1365,
1365,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Queens of Egypt?\",,1366,
1366,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"That's my favorite game!\",,1367,
1367,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"When I do laundry I try to sneak in a few games at the arcade.\",,1368,
1368,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"I even have the high score.\",,1369,
1369,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"It has the cutest graphics.\",,1370,
1370,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"The power ups are like no other game I've played.\",,1371,
1371,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"If you like shmups at all, I highly recommend it.\",,1372,
1372,,Summer,sammy_d,\"What's a . . .\",,1373,
1373,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Shump?\",,1374,
1374,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Oh.\\nThat's what we call Shoot 'em Up games on the online arcade bulletin board.\",,1375,
1375,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"You know? Games where you fly around and shoot stuff.\",,1376,
1376,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Usually you're a spaceship or something, but in Queens of Egypt you get to play as the graceful Nefertiti and the cunning Celopatra.\",,1377,
1377,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Good to know. Maybe I'll give it a try some time. \",,1360,
1378,,Summer,sammy_d,\"What’s with all the laundry?\",,1379,
1379,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"My husband runs a barbeque food truck.\",,1380,
1380,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"He’s a very messy cook but he makes some mean ribs.\",,1381,
1381,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"I spend every Monday here because these machines are great at getting sauce out of the towels.\",,1360,
1382,,Summer,sammy_d,\"What is something fun to do around town?\",,1383,
1383,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"On fridays, a bunch of people meet at the beach to play sand volleyball.\",,1384,
1384,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"There's lots of loud music and it's a great time.\",,1385,
1385,,Summer,sammy_d,\"I like loud music.\",,1360,
1386,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Have you seen a portable radio in here.\",,1387,
1387,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"Sorry sweetie. I haven't.\",,1360,
1388,,Summer,sammy_d,\"Bye Sammy.\",,1389,
1389,,Sammy,sammy_d,\"You should come to Oscars’s BBQ by the beach. You won’t regret it!\",,END,
