1401,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"What can I help you with?\",The Game|Tips|Goodbye,1402|1407|1412,
1402,,Summer,jeff_d,\"How’s the game going?\",,1403,
1403,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"Oh, not too bad.\",,1404,
1404,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"I am practicing for an upcoming tournament. I am consistently getting over 200 points a game.\",,1405,
1405,,Summer,jeff_d,\"Impressive. I got a 112 once.\",,1406,
1406,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"Not bad. Keep up work kid.\",,1401,
1407,,Summer,jeff_d,\"Do you have any tips to better my game?\",,1408,
1408,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"Practice doesn’t necessarily make perfect.\",,1409,
1409,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"If you are practicing the wrong skills, your game will get worse.\",,1410,
1410,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"You need to make sure your fundamentals are good if you want to improve.\",,1411,
1411,,Summer,jeff_d,\"Good to know.\",,1401,
1412,,Summer,jeff_d,\"See ya later.\",,1413,
1413,,Jeff,jeff_d,\"Stay out of the gutter.\",,END,
