1439,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Uh, he lost his radio and I’m trying to find it.\",,1440,
1440,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Oh really?\",,1441,
1441,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Hmm.\",,1442,
1442,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Is it the black radio?\",,1443,
1443,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Yeah. \",,1444,
1444,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I don’t have it here.\",,1445,
1445,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Do you know where it is?\",,1446,
1446,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I saw it at the arcade.\",,1447,
1447,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Is it still there?\",,1448,
1448,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"It should be.\",,1449,
1449,not_has_item:daves_radio,Summer,rodney_d,\"Maybe it is. Maybe it isn’t.\",,1450,
1450,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Thanks for the info.\",,1451,
