1473,not_knows:Asked_Once,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I found it at this machine.\",,1474,secretly_learn:Dave_Anything
1474,not_knows:Asked_Once,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I guess whoever had it before me didn’t care enough about enough it to take it with them.\",,1471,secretly_learn:Asked_Once
1475,not_knows:Asked_Twice,Summer,rodney_d,\"Please give it back.\",,1476,
1476,not_knows:Asked_Twice,Rodney,rodney_d,\"No.\",,1477,
1477,not_knows:Asked_Twice,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Finders keepers, losers weepers.\",,1471,secretly_learn:Asked_Twice
