1485,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Stop being a jerk and give me the radio.\",,1486,
1486,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"If you want this radio you’ll have to trade me for it.\\nAnd it has to be something good.\",,END,
1487,,Summer,rodney_d,\"Bye\",,END,
