1520,,Max,max_d,\"I saw that you and Rodney had a bit of a confrontation. \",,1521,
1521,,Max,max_d,\"Do I need to call the cops on him?\",,1522,
1522,,Max,max_d,\"Or worse, his mom?\",,1523,
1523,,Summer,max_d,\"No.\\nI don't think so.\\nEverything is fine.\",,1524,
1524,,Summer,max_d,\"Rodney took Dave's radio and so I stole it back. \",,1525,
1525,,Summer,max_d,\"He didn't even really seem to care that I did.\",,1526,
1526,,Max,max_d,\"You know. I think that all the kids in town get along pretty well.\",,1527,
1527,,Max,max_d,\"But some of the kids are reaching the age where they start acting\\n...\\ndifferently.\",,1528,
1528,,Max,max_d,\"It happens to everyone. I have a buddy named Anthony. We didn't talk for most of high school.\",,1529,
1529,,Max,max_d,\"Then one day we ran into each other at the grocery and neither one of us could even remember why we stop talking.\",,1530,
1530,,Max,max_d,\"I don't think that Rodney is a bad kid. I just think he's going though it right now.\",,1531,
1531,,Summer,max_d,\"I guess that makes sense.\",,1532,
1532,,Max,max_d,\"Anyhoo.\",,1551,
1533,,,,\"\",,,
1534,,Summer,max_d,\"What can you tell me about the kid on the Ape Architect machine?\",,1535,
1535,,Max,max_d,\"That's Rodney. He's usually a good kid.\\nHe's a real arcade wizard. \",,1536,secretly_learn:Rodney_Who
1536,,Max,max_d,\"Last week I played some Outback Brawlers with him.\",,1537,
1537,,Max,max_d,\"He won every match.\",,1538,
1538,,Max,max,d,\"And I like to think I'm pretty good at the game.\",,1539,
1539,,Max,max_d,\"Anyhoo.\",,1290,
1540,,,,\"\",,,
1541,,,,\"\",,,
1542,,Summer,max_d,\"Dave told me he left his radio at the Ape Architect machine. \",,1543,
1543,,Summer,max_d,\"Do you have any info that could help me get Dave's radio back?\",,1544,
1544,,Max,max_d,\"Well, Rodney was the only one I saw on that game today.\",,1545,secretly_learn:Rodney_Who
1545,,Max,max_d,\"He was pretty intent on breaking his own high score.\",,1546,
1546,,Max,max_d,\"If Dave left his radio on that machine Rodney might know its whereabouts.\",,1547,
1547,,Summer,max_d,\"Thanks.\\nI think that helps.\",,1290,
