1572,,Summer,max_d,\"Are you really good at bowling?\",,1573,
1573,,Max,max_d,\"No. Not at all.\",,1574,
1574,,Summer,max_d,\"What?\",,1575,
1575,,Summer,max_d,\"You run a bowling alley and you're not any good at playing the game?\",,1576,
1576,,Max,max_d,\"It's true. I'm quite terrible at bowling.\",,1577,
1577,,Max,max_d,\"I would much rather play video games or arcade games.\",,1560,secretly_learn:Favorite_Game
1578,,Summer,max_d,\"What's the deal with Rodney?\",,1579,
1579,,Max,max_d,\"What do you mean?\",,1580,
1580,,Summer,max_d,\"He's kind of a jerk.\",,1581,
1581,,Max,max_d,\"Oh that.\",,1582,
1582,,Max,max_d,\"Rodney can be\\n...\\nprickly.\",,1583,
1583,,Max,max_d,\"He's been a bit of a loner lately.\",,1560,
1584,,Summer,max_d,\"What's your favorite game to play?\",,1585,
1585,,Max,max_d,\"That sure is a loaded question.\",,1586,
1586,,Max,max_d,\"In the arcade here I like playing Travelin' Banjo Man.\",,1587,
1587,,Max,max_d,\"I don't typically like pinball but that game has folk music that changes and evolves to how you are playing.\",,1588,
1588,,Max,max_d,\"As a fan of bluegrass and folk music; that makes it worth playing to me.\",,1589,
1589,,Max,max_d,\"At home I like to play Exoteric Warrior.\",,1590,
1590,,Max,max_d,\"It's a deeply engrosing adventure game.\",,1591,
1591,,Max,max_d,\"it takes place in a huge fantasy world. I have played it a lot and have barely scratched the surface of what can be done.,,1592,
1592,,Summer,max_d,\"That sounds complicated.\",1593,
1593,,Max,max_d,\"It is actually very easy to get into.\",,1594,
1594,,Max,max_d,\"If you get a change to try it; you really should.\",,1595,
1595,,Summer,max_d,\"Maybe I will.\",,1596,
1596,,Max,max_d,\"You might also see it called by it's orginal name. Exoteric Quest.\",,1597,
1597,,Max,max_d,\"Apparently when it was being released in America they wanted it to sound, cooler.\",,1598,
1598,,Max,max_d,\"Enough about me.\",,1599,
1599,,Max,max_d,\"What about you?\",,1600,
