1635,,,,\"I like managing the falling building pieces while controlling Rocky the Ape.\",,1560,
1636,,,,\"I like Steamboat Speedway.\\nRacing down the Mississippi River is a lot of fun.\",,1637,
1637,,,,\"I got a good deal on that game because it's supposed to come with two cabnets but the second one was broken.\",,1638,
1638,,,,\"The only downside is no multiplayer.\",,1560,
1639,,,,\"I like Take This Outback.\\nA fighting game from down under.\",,1640,
1640,,,,\"Which fighter do you like the best?\",,1641,
1641,,,,\"The Great Emu Warrior!\",,1560,
1642,,,,\"I like Travlin' Banjo Man.\\nIt's the best pinball machine.\",,1643,
