1895,time:1700-2400,Summer,rodney_d,\"What about that 5 bucks you promised?\",,1896,
1896,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"I actually hoped you had forgot about that.\",,1897,
1897,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"But, a deal's a deal.\",,1898,
1898,time:1700-2400,Dave,,\"Here you go.\",,END,
1899,,,,\"\",,,
1900,,,,\"\",,,
1901,,Dave,dave_d,\"So.\",,1902,
1902,,Dave,dave_d,\"Summer, how long are you in town?\",,1903,
1903,,Summer,dave_d,\"I leave in six days.\\nOn Sunday.\",,1904,
1904,time:0-1700,Evie,evie_d,\"You should hang out with us while you're here.\",,1905,
1905,time:0-1700,Jessica,jessica_d,\"Yeah. You're cool.\",,1906,
1906,time:0-1700,Jimmy,jimmy_d,\"You can be part of the club.\",,1907,
1907,time:0-1700,Summer,jimmy_d,\"Do you guys have a club name?\",,1908,
1908,time:0-1700,Roberta,roberta_d,\"No!\",,1909,
1909,time:0-1700,Summer,roberta_d,\"Oh.\",,1910,
1910,time:0-1700,Jimmy,jimmy_d,\"Yeah. It's very un-cool to have a name for your very cool radio club.\",,1911,
1911,time:0-1700,Evie,evie_d,\"Do we have to have this conversation again?\",,1912,
1912,time:0-1700,Wes,wes_d,\"I hope not.\",,1913,
1913,time:0-1700,Jimmy,jimmy_d,\"No.\\nNot now.\",,1914,
1914,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"You should hang out with us while you're here.\",,1915,
1915,time:1700-2400,Summer,dave_d,\"You want me to hang out with you guys?\",,1916,
1916,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"You'll fit right in.\",,1917,
1917,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Everyone seems to like you.\",,1918,
1918,time:1700-2400,Summer,dave_d,\"Really?\",,1919,
1919,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Yeah.\",,1920,
1920,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"We were talking about you behind your back.\",,1921,
1921,time:1700-2400,Summer,dave_d,\"What?\",,1922,
1922,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"We all think you're cool.\",,1923,
1923,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"And they'll flip when they find out you found my radio.\",,1924,
1924,time:1700-2400,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I would have given it back.\",,1925,
1925,time:1700-2400,Dave,,\"Yeah, yeah.\",,1926,
1926,,Dave,dave_d,\"So what do you say?\",,1927,
1927,,Dave,dave_d,\"Do you want to hang out with us while you are here?\",,1928,
1928,,Summer,dave_d,\"Sure.\",,1929,
1929,time:0-1700,Jessica,jessica_d,\"Great!\",,1930,
1930,time:0-1700,Wes,wes_d,\"We could use a detective in the group.\",,1931,
1931,time:0-1700,Evie,evie_d,\"What for?\",,1932,
1932,time:0-1700,Wes,wes_d,\"In case Dave misplaces something again.\",,1933,
1933,time:0-1700,Dave,dave_d,\"Har, har.\",,1934,
1934,time:0-1700,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Hehehe.\",,1935,
1935,time:0-1700,Roberta,roberta_d,\"Hey Rodney.\\nAre you going to actually hang out with us now?\",,1936,
1936,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Awesome.\",,1937,
1937,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"I'll let everyone know.\",,1938,
1938,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Hey Rodney.\\nMaybe you could start hanging out with us again.\",,1939,
1939,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Maybe.\",,1940,
1940,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I don't know.\",,1941,
1941,,Dave,dave_d,\"You should.\",,1942,
1942,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"I gotta go home.\",,1943,
1943,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"See you later.\",,1944,
1944,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"...\",,1945,
1945,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Hey Summer.\",,1945,
1946,,Rodney,rodney_d,\"Sorry again.\",,1947,
1947,,Summer,rodney_d,\"All good.\",,END,
1948,,,,\"\",,,
1949,,,,\"\",,,
1950,time:0-1700,Jessica,jessica_d,\"Hey Summer.\",,1951,
1951,time:0-1700,Jessica,jessica_d,\"We have a certain something planned for tomorrow.\",,1952,
1952,time:0-1700,Wes,wes_d,\"Oh yeah.\",,1953,
1953,time:0-1700,Wes,wes_d,\"I forgot about that.\",,1954,
1954,time:0-1700,Evie,evie_d,\"How could you forget? We've been talking about it for weeks.\",,1955,
1955,time:0-1700,Roberta,roberta_d,\"We should meet up at the library tomorrow morning to talk about it.\",,1956,
1956,time:0-1700,Jimmy,jimmy_d,\"What time does the library open?\",,1957,
1957,time:0-1700,Roberta,roberta_d,\"I think it opens at 9am but I won't be there right at open.\",,1958,
1958,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Hey Summer.\",,1959,
1959,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"I almost forgot that we have something planned for tommorow.\",,1960,
1960,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"You can join us.\\n\\nI promise it will be cool.\",,1961,
1961,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Meet us in the Library tomorrow morning. We're finalizing our plans then.\",,1962,
1962,time:1700-2400,Summer,dave_d,\"I have to help my mom clean out the attic tomorrow morning, but after that; I can be there.\",,1963,
1963,time:1700-2400,Dave,dave_d,\"Great.\",,1964,
1964,,Dave,dave_d,\"Sorry to keep you in the dark Summer, but you can find out our plans tomorrow in the study room.\",,1965,
1965,,Summer,dave_d,\"Okay.\\nI'll see you tomorrow.\",,1965,
1966,,Summer,dave_d,\"Bye everyone.\",,END,
